codex
Two findings stand out. `M5` does depend on `ANCHOR_EXC` alone; a stepped read of `isteer` after writing `inten` would cheaply expose that alias. The D-arm over-kills are also explained by the probe: any later step failure forces all D value rows red, discarding snapshots captured before the failure.
